      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "What is the amplitude of the function $f(x)=5\\operatorname{cos}⁡x?$",
      "worked_solution": "Given a function in the form $f(x)=A\\operatorname{cos}⁡(Bx+C)+D,$ the amplitude is $|A|.$\n\nSince $A=5,$ we have that the amplitude is $|A|=|5|=5.$",
